CM_ SG_ 104 AUX_LATERAL_MOTION_304_CANDIDATE_RAW "Radar firmware: one 17-bit offset-binary field, raw*80/2^17-40, valid below 131072 (formerly read as signed 16 bits at 304 plus a direction bit at 320). Bit 320 is its sign: set on 49.7% of frames, which is why it agreed with the 16-bit value being nonnegative. Its scale (0.00061 per count) is far below the earlier 0.005-0.12 m/s bracket, so it is probably not a lateral speed in m/s; with the firmware decode it does not follow the azimuth rate, dY/dt, lateral velocity or its rate either (r < 0.08; docs/object-length-217.md). About 0 when normalized closing is invalid.";
