CM_ SG_ 106 ANGULAR_WIDTH_480_RAW "Angular-width measure (accepted 2026-09-29 on held-out routes): follows the azimuth-edge width (Spearman >= 0.8) and scales as about 1/range within tracks on 57 of 60 routes. Radar firmware: 0.0002*raw, no range check; stored next to AUX2_378. 0 while AUX2_378 holds its default.";
CM_ SG_ 106 ANGULAR_WIDTH_COARSE_COPY_CANDIDATE_RAW "Radar firmware: 0.0002*raw, no range check; stored next to AZIMUTH_EDGE_B. Byte 61 equals byte 59 on 99.7-100% of observations.";
