CM_ SG_ 112 ENUM_106_CANDIDATE_RAW "Radar firmware: one 3-bit field, raw, valid below 5 (formerly read as flags at bits 106 and 107). Shares: 0 14.6%, 1 83.8%, 2 1.0%, 3 0.7%, 4 under 0.1%. Bit 106 (odd values) is set on about 40% of newborn frames and 97-99% after 1 s and agrees with LIFE_STATE 1 on 96%; bit 107 (values 2-3) is mostly on mature same-direction movers. Meaning unresolved.";
