CM_ SG_ 122 ENUM_109_CANDIDATE_RAW "Not read by the radar firmware. Values 0-4. 1 on most established tracks; 2-4 mostly on same-direction movers near the path with high existence. Not an object class (metric width about 1.7 m for all values) and not a left/right lane code. Meaning unresolved.";
