CM_ SG_ 122 NORMALIZED_RATE_RAW "Bosch A NORMALIZED_CLOSING counterpart. Radar firmware: 0.001*raw-40 (1/s), valid below 65001. Accepted 2026-10-02: the research decode 0.001*(raw-40000) 1/s matches the firmware exactly; approximately vRel/(dRel+2.3 m) and follows Doppler vRel, not range change. 64999 marks invalid in the data (TTC 0, TTC sigma 0 and normalized-closing sigma 0 in the same frame), though the firmware getter accepts it.";
